\section{Source support}{

\code{source_support} says what a row stands for in its source, for example
\code{observed_point_profile} (a profile described and sampled at a point),
\code{map_unit_profile_relation} (a profile linked to a soil map unit),
\code{polygon_estimate} (values estimated for a map unit), \code{non_spatial_profile}
and \code{non_spatial_estimate} (without their own geometry).
