\section{Markings and flags}{

Markings are information the source or the server attaches to a value, a
layer or a profile (the laboratory method facets, a "guessed value",
duplicates in other datasets); flags (\code{value_flags}) are warnings such as
\code{extreme}. Neither changes a value. See \code{\link[=soil_markings]{soil_markings()}}, \code{\link[=soil_flags]{soil_flags()}}.
}

